---
const {mode='whole'}=Astro.props;
const selective=mode==='selective';
---
<figure class="system-diagram">
<svg viewBox="0 0 620 410" role="img" aria-label={selective?'Utility and generator feed approved transfer equipment connected to a dedicated backed-up-load panel; other loads remain utility-only.':'Utility and generator feed an automatic transfer switch, which feeds a service panel with priority and managed loads.'}>
<title>{selective?'Selective-load arrangement':'Whole-panel transfer with load management'}</title>
<defs><marker id={`arrow-${mode}`} viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10Z" fill="#45645d"/></marker></defs>
<g fill="none" stroke="#45645d" stroke-width="2" marker-end={`url(#arrow-${mode})`}><path d="M150 80V135H275V170"/><path d="M470 80V135H345V170"/><path d="M310 240V282"/><path d="M310 340V365H140V380"/><path d="M310 340V365H470V380"/></g>
<g fill="#f5f5ef" stroke="#c6cec7"><rect x="50" y="20" width="200" height="60"/><rect x="370" y="20" width="200" height="60"/><rect x="180" y="170" width="260" height="70"/><rect x="160" y="282" width="300" height="58"/></g>
<g font-family="system-ui,sans-serif" font-size="18" fill="#21332e" text-anchor="middle"><text x="150" y="56">Utility supply</text><text x="470" y="56">Standby generator</text><text x="310" y="198">Automatic transfer switch</text><text x="310" y="224" font-size="14">Connects one source at a time</text><text x="310" y="316">{selective?'Backed-up-load panel':'Service panel / backed-up circuits'}</text><text x="140" y="403">Priority loads</text><text x="470" y="403">Managed loads</text></g></svg>
<ol class="mobile-system"><li>Utility supply + standby generator</li><li>Automatic transfer switch<br/><small>Connects one source at a time</small></li><li>{selective?"Dedicated backed-up-load panel":"Service panel / backed-up circuits"}</li><li>Priority loads + managed loads</li></ol>
<figcaption>Conceptual {selective?'selective-load':'whole-panel'} arrangement. {selective?'Other circuits remain outside the backed-up panel.':'A whole-panel transfer arrangement does not mean every appliance can run together.'} Disconnects, grounding, overcurrent protection and wiring details are intentionally omitted. This is an editorial illustration, not an installation drawing.</figcaption></figure>

<style>.mobile-system{display:none}@media(max-width:480px){.system-diagram svg{display:none}.mobile-system{display:grid;gap:.7rem;list-style:none;padding:0}.mobile-system li{padding:1rem;background:#f5f5ef;border:1px solid #c6cec7;text-align:center;font-size:1rem}.mobile-system li+li::before{content:"↓";display:block;color:#45645d;margin:-.5rem 0 .3rem}.mobile-system small{font-size:.8rem}}</style>
